        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "两个盘点都救了回来，抢七却以六比八丢掉首盘。第二盘他两次破发，六比一。决胜盘第三局再破发，十四个发球局，他一个没丢。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "466f534d5e8cb9c2d6bddee2ef3760052e2d7c2934c68e46f4e1ba1e0ac91b69",
      "words_sha256": "735eedb7ae4e4c758c037da5f26dca5f26528289f37864a9474fe00de23a3a92"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:506908cd798c312803731ec44951cb7763827300a044a9de1df97bdfa7f34bc1",
      "request_id": "506908cd798c312803731ec44951cb7763827300a044a9de1df97bdfa7f34bc1",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "1289b9e486cc05c97f10adfaba35a581",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二六赛季第四冠，生涯第二十五冠，也是他第一次成功卫冕。梅德韦杰夫的冠军里，你最难忘哪一座？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "f1a7874855031d445183457cfdaa41fb7dc1c333533edf9afa21c83d75963a7c",
      "words_sha256": "21a93807aceb24c2e88b46f8b741a82669c8614021bfee657c8e7da8a4e0ec4f"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:85d118704b1d7e07ec35b2af4c41c28a6ca8f762494741200be09b2b16673243",
      "request_id": "85d118704b1d7e07ec35b2af4c41c28a6ca8f762494741200be09b2b16673243",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "892eb22e403d89f3013caa190aebb999",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "作为头号种子，他首轮轮空。第二轮和四分之一决赛连赢四盘，半决赛布勃利克只打了一盘就退赛。打进决赛之前，他一盘没丢。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "3b4e54afd444a961602e45070df781e1728d5d7668237f0f6562b7ad82d77a37",
      "words_sha256": "014679666940f01cd72bcee7dbff3ffccd00b189fb648212a5b881f32dc75d73"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:8c4704104638a020e43877105b6f48e4c0da399fb95bb724ee9272532ef89a19",
      "request_id": "8c4704104638a020e43877105b6f48e4c0da399fb95bb724ee9272532ef89a19",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "1f6f85a0ee748053bfbef2bb6d0663cd",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决赛对手巴西拉什维利，从资格赛一路打上来，半决赛淘汰了西西帕斯。第一盘五比六，梅德韦杰夫发球，十五比四十，对手拿到两个盘点。第一个盘点，对手选择和他反手对拉，那正是梅德韦杰夫最拿手的。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "7b34ffe34f6f4b76a606aa33e552202eb4e44198531d84795b7a7ccd15360ac8",
      "words_sha256": "f39671a67b8d84e1b68588c6494b8f99f1fb2186eed447e78a558d56c7b1bacb"
    },
    {
